---

The exported C API implemented by src/dll/uwc_linux.c mirrors the public
interface of hecomi/uWindowCapture (https://github.com/hecomi/uWindowCapture),
which is distributed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018 hecomi.
No source code from that project is included; the function names, structures
and semantics were reproduced so that XSOverlay's managed code keeps working.
